msgid "--Let's Have a Fun Chat with Yasuko!--"
msgstr "--¡Una charla divertida con Yasuko!--"

msgid "Yasuko「Ehehe～ Well? Does Yacchan look＿good?」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Jejeje～ ¿Y bien? ¿Yacchan se ve bien?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Well...... Not bad, I guess?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bueno...... ¿No está mal, supongo?」"

msgid "Yasuko「Thanks, Ryuu-chan～」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Gracias, Ryuu-chan～」"

msgid "Yasuko「Whaaat? Want your allowance～?」"
msgstr "Yasuko「¿Quéee? ¿Quieres tu mesada～?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No, that wasn't what I meant by that＿look......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No, no era eso lo que quería＿decir con esa mirada......」"

msgid "Yasuko「Kyaaa～～ ① That expression of＿Ryuu-chan's looks just like hiiis～!!」"
msgstr "Yasuko「¡Kyaaa～～ ① Esa expresión de Ryuu-chan＿es igualita a la de éeel～!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「\"His\"......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿\"Él\"......?」"

msgid "Yasuko「Hey, hey～ Do that look again～①」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Oye, oye～ Pon esa mirada otra vez～①」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It's no use. She's not listening......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Es inútil. No está escuchando......」"

msgid "Yasuko「What's wrooong? Sleepyyy?」"
msgstr "Yasuko「¿Qué pasaaa? ¿Tienes sueñooo?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Nah...... is that how I look?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No...... ¿así es como me veo?」"

msgid "Yasuko「Ryuu-chan's eyes are glitteringgg～」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Los ojos de Ryuu-chan brillaaan～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Sure you didn't mean \"glaring\"?＿Great, even I'm saying it now.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Segura de que no quisiste＿decir \"fulminan\"? Genial, ahora＿hasta yo lo digo.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Glitteringgg☆」"
msgstr "Yasuko「¡Brillaaan☆!」"

msgid "Yasuko「Whaaat? Boreddd?」"
msgstr "Yasuko「¿Quéee? ¿Aburridooo?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I'm not bored.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No estoy aburrido.」"

msgid "Yasuko「That's fine thennn～」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Entonces está bieeen～」"

msgid "Yasuko「This is the perfect amount～」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Esta es la cantidad perfecta～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Is that so?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eso crees?」"

msgid "Yasuko「It is～」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Así es～」"

msgid "Yasuko「That's not trueee. This makeup is in＿vogue. It says so in all the＿magazinesss.」"
msgstr "Yasuko「No es ciertooo. Este maquillaje＿está de modaaa. Lo dicen todas＿las revistasss.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「In vogue...... There's no comeback to＿that.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「De moda...... Ante eso＿no tengo respuesta.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Does ittt...... not look that gooddd?」"
msgstr "Yasuko「¿Acasooo...... no se ve tan bieeen?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It's not that it doesn't look good.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No es que no se vea bien.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Hmmm～ This makeup isn't even that＿thickkk～」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Mmmm～ Este maquillaje ni siquiera＿es tan cargadooo～」"

msgid "Yasuko「It's fine, it's fine～ The customers＿compliment it and say it's cute.」"
msgstr "Yasuko「No pasa nada～ Los clientes lo elogian＿y dicen que es lindo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I see. If it's popular with the＿customers, then it would seem I have＿no right to criticize it.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ya veo. Si es popular entre los＿clientes, parece que no tengo＿derecho a criticarlo.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Whaa～? It's normalll～」"
msgstr "Yasuko「¿Quéee～? Es normaaal～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Normal, huh......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Normal, ¿eh......?」"

msgid "Yasuko「Whaaat～? It's a name that Yacchan's＿SUPER fond of～」"
msgstr "Yasuko「¿Quéee～? ¡Es un nombre que a Yacchan＿le encanta MUCHÍSIMO～!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What about it do you like, exactly?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué te gusta de él, exactamente?」"

msgid "Yasuko「How it's written, maybeee? It's like＿\"Miracle\" plus \"Rambo\"～」"
msgstr "Yasuko「¿Cómo se escribe, tal veeez? Es＿como \"Miracle\" más \"Rambo\"～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I don't get how those two equal＿Mirano......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No entiendo cómo esos dos＿forman Mirano......」"

msgid "Yasuko「That's how the customers remember it＿so easilyyy～」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Así los clientes lo recuerdan＿muy fácilmenteee～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Now I get it. Feels like it's hard to＿forget.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ahora lo entiendo. Parece＿difícil de olvidar.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Is that a complimeeent? Thank you'n☆」"
msgstr "Yasuko「¿Eso es un cumpliiido? ¡Graciaaas☆!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, yeah......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, sí......」"

msgid "Yasuko「But that's part of the jobbb～」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Pero eso es parte del trabajooo～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Well, drink in moderation, then.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Bueno, bebe con moderación.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Nnnn...... You don't have to say it.＿Yacchan will be careful not to overdo＿it～」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Mmmm...... No hace falta que lo digas.＿Yacchan tendrá cuidado de no pasarse～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I see. Sorry, that was unnecessary of＿me.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ya veo. Perdón, estuvo＿de más que lo dijera.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Okaaay～ Yacchan will be carefulll.」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Bieeen～ Yacchan tendrá cuidadooo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Good on you for being straightforward.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Qué bien que seas tan receptiva.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Worried for Yacchan's saaake?＿Thanks～①」"
msgstr "Yasuko「¿Preocupado por Yacchaaan? ¡Gracias～①!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I guess. \"Safety first\" and all that.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Supongo. \"La seguridad ante todo\" y eso.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Yacchan can stand to gain something＿if Ryuu-chan troubles her, you＿knowww?」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Yacchan hasta puede salir ganando si＿Ryuu-chan le da problemas, ¿sabeees?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What does that mean? I don't get it.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué significa eso? No entiendo.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Ehehe☆ Don't hold anything back from＿Yacchan, okay'n?」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Jejeje☆ No te cohíbas＿con Yacchan, ¿síii?」"

msgid "Yasuko「Don't worry about thattt～ But it would＿be good if your memory came back＿soonnn.」"
msgstr "Yasuko「No te preocupes por esooo～ Pero＿sería bueno que recuperaras＿la memoria prontooo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......True that.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Es verdad.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Yacchan just loooves Ryuu-chan's＿eyesss～①」"
msgstr "Yasuko「¡A Yacchan le encaaantan los＿ojos de Ryuu-chan～①!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「This scary glare?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Esta mirada aterradora?」"

msgid "Yasuko「You don't get ittt～ That's what makes＿them coolll.」"
msgstr "Yasuko「No lo entiendeees～ Eso es lo＿que los hace geniales.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I get the feeling Yasuko's the only one＿who thinks that......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Tengo la sensación de que Yasuko es＿la única que piensa eso......」"

msgid "Yasuko「You want to change themmm?」"
msgstr "Yasuko「¿Quieres cambiarlosss?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Well, I guess.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bueno, supongo.」"

msgid "Yasuko「They're fine as isss.」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Están bien asíii.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Oh really.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Ah, en serio.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Whaaa～? That's how you feel,＿Ryuu-channn......? That's kinda......＿meannn......」"
msgstr "Yasuko「¿Quéee～? ¿Eso es lo que piensas,＿Ryuu-channn......? Eso es un＿poco...... cruel......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Uh, no, that's, er, that's not really what＿I meant......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eh, no, o sea, ehm, no era eso＿lo que quería decir......」"

msgid "Yasuko「But Ryuu-chan is just so＿Ryuu-channn......」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Pero es que Ryuu-chan es＿tan Ryuu-channn......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah, no complaints there.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí, ahí no tengo quejas.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Then what should I call youuu?」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Entonces, ¿cómo debería llamarteee?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What about...... \"Ryuuji\"?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué tal...... \"Ryuuji\"?」"

msgid "Yasuko「......Ryuuji-chan?」"
msgstr "Yasuko「......¿Ryuuji-chan?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Not that...... Actually, never mind, let's＿leave it as it is.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eso no...... La verdad, olvídalo,＿dejémoslo como está.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Don't call you Ryuu-chan anymore?」"
msgstr "Yasuko「¿Ya no te llamo Ryuu-chan?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Ah, no, I didn't mean it like that.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, no, no lo decía en ese sentido.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Yacchan's so lonely, gansu......」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Yacchan está tan solita, gansu......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Sorry, I take it back!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Perdón, lo retiro!」"

msgid "Yasuko「Why is it embarrassinggg? Yacchan＿isn't embarrassed at all, you knowww?」"
msgstr "Yasuko「¿Por qué da vergüenzaaa? A Yacchan no＿le da nada de vergüenza, ¿sabeees?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Well, you're not on the receiving end,＿so of course you're not embarrassed.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bueno, a ti no es a quien llaman así,＿así que claro que no te da vergüenza.」"

msgid "Yasuko「But Ryuu-chan is Ryuu-chan, so that＿won't change～」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Pero Ryuu-chan es Ryuu-chan,＿así que eso no cambiará～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I don't get her reasoning, but I guess＿she doesn't feel like calling me＿anything other than \"Ryuu-chan\".」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No entiendo su lógica, pero supongo＿que no tiene ganas de llamarme de otra＿forma que no sea \"Ryuu-chan\".」"

msgid "Yasuko「I totally understanddd～ Yacchan can't＿leave Taiga-chan alone eitherrr.」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Lo entiendooo del todo～ Yacchan tampoco＿puede dejar sola a Taiga-channn.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You too, huh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Tú también, eh?」"

msgid "Yasuko「Ryuu-chan is a good nurturer. You＿take care of Yacchan too, after all～」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Ryuu-chan cuida muy bien a los＿demás. Después de todo, también＿cuidas a Yacchan～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah, since I can't exactly leave you＿alone either......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí, ya que a ti tampoco puedo＿dejarte sola......」"

msgid "Yasuko「Is that bad?」"
msgstr "Yasuko「¿Eso es malo?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It's not \"bad\", but......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No es \"malo\", pero......」"

msgid "Yasuko「Yacchan is happy when Taiga-chan＿comes over. So it's fine～」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Yacchan se alegra cuando viene＿Taiga-chan. Así que está bien～」"

msgid "Yasuko「Ryuu-chan, do you hate Taiga-chan～?」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Ryuu-chan, ¿odias a Taiga-chan～?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I don't hate her. I was just wondering.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No la odio. Solo me lo preguntaba.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Why would you wonderrr? It's nothing＿out of the ordinary～」"
msgstr "Yasuko「¿Por qué te lo preguntarías? No＿es nada fuera de lo común～」"

msgid "Yasuko「Waaah～ Your words sound so colddd～」"
msgstr "Yasuko「¡Uaaah～! Qué fríaaas son tus palabras～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Don't cry! I wasn't trying to say she＿shouldn't come over.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡No llores! No quería decir＿que no debiera venir.」"

msgid "Yasuko「......Reallyyy?」"
msgstr "Yasuko「......¿De verdaddd?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah. So don't make that face, please.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí. No pongas esa cara, por favor.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Huh? If Ryuu-chan makes enough food＿for Taiga-chan, shouldn't she come＿overrr?」"
msgstr "Yasuko「¿Eh? Si Ryuu-chan prepara comida＿suficiente para Taiga-chan,＿¿no debería veniiir?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Good point.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Buen punto.」"

msgid "Yasuko「What do you mean by \"midget\"～? Isn't＿that being mean to Taiga-channn?」"
msgstr "Yasuko「¿Cómo que \"enana\"～? ¿No es eso＿ser malo con Taiga-channn?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Sorry, wrong word choice.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Perdón, elegí mal la palabra.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Is she even capable of restraint......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Acaso es capaz de contenerse......?」"

msgid "Yasuko「Yup. And Taiga-chan eats like your＿food is a delicacyyy～」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Sip. ¡Y Taiga-chan come como si＿tu comida fuera un manjarrr～!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yeah, she loves to eat, after all.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí, le encanta comer, después de todo.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Yacchan loooves girls that eat a lot～」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Yacchan adooora a las chicas comilonas～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Seeing her eat makes me feel good,＿admittedly.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Verla comer me hace sentir＿bien, hay que admitirlo.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Are you worried for Yacchan's sake～?＿Thank you'n.」"
msgstr "Yasuko「¿Estás preocupado por＿Yacchan～? Graciaaas.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I guess. You might get some＿unpleasant customers......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Supongo. Podrías toparte con algunos＿clientes desagradables......」"

msgid "Yasuko「There are hard times, but it's okay!＿This job is Yacchan's faaaavorite☆」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Hay momentos duros, ¡pero está＿bien! Este trabajo es el faaavorito＿de Yacchan☆」"

msgid "Yasuko「But talking to customers is pretty＿fun～ You can learn things that you＿never knew beforeee.」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Pero hablar con los clientes es＿muy divertido～ Puedes aprender cosas＿que no sabías anteees.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「When you put it that way, it does seem＿interesting.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Cuando lo dices así, sí＿parece interesante.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Whyyy～?」"
msgstr "Yasuko「¿Por quéee～?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「That way you could have a more＿healthy lifestyle.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Así podrías llevar un estilo＿de vida más saludable.」"

msgid "Yasuko「But Yacchan's always been a night＿owlll～ It's too late to change～」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Pero Yacchan siempre＿ha sido muy nocturnaaa～＿Ya es muy tarde para cambiar～」"

msgid "Yasuko「Can't do thattt. After all, Yacchan is＿the proprietress of the bar.」"
msgstr "Yasuko「No puedo hacer esooo. Después de todo,＿Yacchan es la propietaria del bar.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「That's true...... Sorry I made such an＿irresponsible suggestion.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Es cierto...... Perdón por hacer una＿sugerencia tan irresponsable.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Does Ryuu-chan get lonely when＿Yacchan's not at home?」"
msgstr "Yasuko「¿Ryuu-chan se siente solo cuando＿Yacchan no está en casa?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It's not that I'm lonely. I'm concerned＿about your health.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No es que me sienta solo.＿Me preocupa tu salud.」"

msgid "Yasuko「In that case, Yacchan is just fine, so no＿need to worryyy～」"
msgstr "Yasuko「En ese caso, Yacchan está de maravilla,＿así que no te preocupesss～」"

msgid "Yasuko「No plans to change jobs right now～」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Por ahora no planeo cambiar de trabajo～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I see. If you're not interested, there's＿nothing more for me to say.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ya veo. Si no te interesa, no＿tengo nada más que decir.」"

msgid "Yasuko「No stretching allowed～」"
msgstr "Yasuko「No se permite estirarse～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I'm not.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No lo estoy haciendo.」"

msgid "Yasuko「It's not allowed～」"
msgstr "Yasuko「No está permitido～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Okay, okay......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Está bien, está bien......」"

msgid "Yasuko「There's this cute girl here called＿Mirano-channn.」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Aquí hay una chica linda＿llamada Mirano-channn.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I know that. I mean what other......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ya lo sé. Me refiero a qué otras......」"

msgid "Yasuko「There's this SUPER POPULAR girl＿here called Mirano-channn.」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Aquí hay una chica SÚPER POPULAR＿llamada Mirano-channn.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Forget it.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Olvídalo.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Look forward to it when you become＿an adult～」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Espéralo con ansias cuando＿te conviertas en adulto～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I see.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ya veo.」"

msgid "Yasuko「There's all kinds of girls here～ but＿recently we got a new recruittt. She's＿young and spunky☆」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Aquí hay todo tipo de chicas～＿pero hace poco llegó una nuevaaa.＿Es joven y pizpireta☆」"

msgid "Ryuuji「\"Young and spunky\" sure is an＿old-fashioned word choice. Take care＿she doesn't laugh at you.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「\"Joven y pizpireta\" es una elección＿de palabras muy anticuada. Ten cuidado＿de que no se ría de ti.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Inko-chan's so cuuute～☆ Yacchan's＿FAVORITE favoriteee～①」"
msgstr "Yasuko「¡Inko-chan es tan liiindo～☆! ¡El＿FAVORITO favoritooo de Yacchan～①!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, you think so too, huh? That's＿awesome.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, ¿tú también lo crees, eh? Qué bien.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Yup. I'm just like Ryuu-chan～」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Sip. Soy igual que Ryuu-chan～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......I'm not too crazy about that part.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Esa parte no me entusiasma mucho.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Yacchan agrees～! Inko-chan always＿seems to understand the most＿important things～」"
msgstr "Yasuko「¡Yacchan coincide～! Inko-chan＿siempre parece entender las＿cosas más importantes～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, I was thinking the same thing,＿actually.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, la verdad estaba pensando lo mismo.」"

msgid "Yasuko「Yacchan's always having Inko-chan＿listen to her talk～」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Yacchan siempre hace que Inko-chan＿la escuche hablar～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Is that why it's like that?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Por eso es así?」"

msgid "Yasuko「......Hmm?」"
msgstr "Yasuko「......¿Mmm?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Never mind......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No importa......」"

msgid "Yasuko「Yacchan likes the way Inko-chan is＿nooow.」"
msgstr "Yasuko「A Yacchan le gusta Inko-chan＿tal como está ahoraaa.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「But it's a parakeet, so it could handle a＿little more......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Pero es un periquito, así que＿podría dar un poco más......」"

msgid "Yasuko「Ryuu-chan, it's parrots, not parakeets,＿that can handle a lot of talkinggg.」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Ryuu-chan, los que hablan muchooo son＿los loros, no los periquitos.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I see...... Crap, Yasuko totally got me＿there......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ya veo...... Rayos, ahí Yasuko＿me dejó sin respuesta......」"

msgid "Yasuko「Yacchan would suppose～ maybe＿that's its own form of talking?」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Yacchan diría～ ¿tal vez esa es＿su propia forma de hablar?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Its own language, huh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Su propio idioma, ¿eh?」"

msgid "Yasuko「Yacchan's sure of it～ So go easy on it,＿okay?」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Yacchan está segura～ Así que＿tenle paciencia, ¿sí?」"

msgid "Yasuko「Even if it isn't fluent, Yacchan can get＿the gist of what it wants to say'n.」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Aunque no hable fluido, Yacchan capta＿la idea de lo que quiere deciiir.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「They can understand each other,＿huh......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Se entienden entre ellos, ¿eh......?」"

msgid "Yasuko「Yacchan wants to hear Inko-chan＿sing～」"
msgstr "Yasuko「Yacchan quiere oír cantar a Inko-chan～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Singing would be even harder......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Cantar sería aún más difícil......」"

